    "lyrics": {
      "text": "The blame-less in the way. Al-le-lu-i--a. Bless-ed art Thou, O Lord, teach__ me___ Thy stat--utes. Al--le-lu-i--a.\n\nMy soul hath longed to de-sire Thy judg-ments__ at all__ times. Al--le-lu-i--a.\n\nMy soul hath slum-bered from de-spond-en--cy, strength--en__ me___ with Thy__ words. Al--le-lu-i--a.\n\nIn-cline my heart un-to Thy tes---ti-mo--nies and not un-to cov-et-ous-ness. Al--le-lu-i--a.\n\nDe-spond-en-cy took hold up-on___ me be-cause of the sin-ners who for-sake Thy__ law. Al--le-lu-i--a.\n\nI_ am a par-tak---er with all them that fear___ Thee, and with them that keep__ Thy___ com-mand--ments. Al--le-lu-i--a.\n\nGlo-ry to the Fa-ther, and to the Son, and to the Ho--ly Spir-it. Both now and ev---er, and un-to the ag-es of ag-es. A-men. Ne, al-le-lu----i---a._____"
    }
  }
